# pixi workspace artifacts
# .pixi/   = env install dir (~250 MB) — always ignored.
# pixi.lock = generated by `pixi lock`. Currently NOT committed: our setup
#   pipeline calls `pixi global install`, which doesn't consume this file
#   (pixi-global has its own state). Until something actually reads the
#   workspace lockfile (e.g., a future tasks-run-in-env or "emit verb"
#   workflow), committing it would imply reproducibility we don't have.
.pixi/
pixi.lock

